          "endOffset": 13783
        },
        {
          "ref": "a3",
          "selectorKind": "TEXT_QUOTE",
          "properties": {},
          "quote": "There was a statistically significant but very small increase in HbA1c in the rapamycin group, and one case of pneumonia.",
          "startOffset": 14264,
          "endOffset": 14385
        },
        {
          "ref": "a4",
          "selectorKind": "TEXT_QUOTE",
          "properties": {},
          "quote": "My reaction to this study is that it’s interesting but quite limited, and a long way from the death knell for rapamycin that some have framed it as.",
          "startOffset": 17394,
          "endOffset": 17542
        },
        {
          "ref": "a5",
          "selectorKind": "TEXT_QUOTE",
